  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：10月Token支出环比升40%，GPU租赁与存储报价分化</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>在10月数据中心观察中记录到，OpenRouter上的大模型Token支出环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40%</span>，高于9月的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28%</span>；Token用量环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>，平均单价环比降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>。支出跑得比用量快，原因不在需求突然放量，而在结构——单价更高的Claude Opus 5.5单月贡献约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.9万</span>亿Token，把加权均价环比推高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWtj5P9kg1z6VAgCvm12CpXGRaaiazicKoXOLNZib63LjdNkttmIHtjOnZjW7gp4fibHAr5oMiakXxgC57E6Nh5yIvxpw5FbKgB78m0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告最值得看的判断是：AI基础设施需求端仍强，但价格信号已经分成两条线。一条是模型调用侧的量价结构，另一条是硬件租赁与存储的报价走势，两者在10月没有同向。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWHooKYG5XbXnASARM4BRtvbic5xERh9JbEQXQVAdWLMx2hjlRhNjgACG5jQTTicWuCB91cRak6uxicsoSSjrFAyia3hyul5URTEJk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. Token支出<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>主要由高价模型的结构切换推动</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWV3UQlBPE5VRbbW6JLjagoibwmKroEGMSowC6e6JZbknyf6zkeicl2VdCTVGBCeBibaBJen31dMhMO0j2WrbPkl6ev7Bcxy4rib8w/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把支出拆开看，用量和单价都在动，但方向相反。10月Token总量环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>，较9月的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">71%</span>明显节奏变化；平均单价环比降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>。支出还能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，靠的是成交量加权价格环比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#737D8C;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">——人工智能免责声明（部分内容由人工智能工具辅助生成）</p><p style=\"margin:0\">撰稿：Emma<br>责编：KC<br>排版：胡桃</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUf9QIAMVloWyNeClyJb0CGT3lgPqIdjWz4SiacGRZjEYXW4r1Kh4Qib1ibdy9JXu1545tfV8oPNNYoH4GEYqhhqIQmwcQbF02mPI/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC桌面\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 47-JPM-Hardware - Networking-Data Center Watch- Token Spend Growth Accelerates in October Amid Mixed GPU Rental and Memory Pricing-261026</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
